## 6. Conceptual Role of the AI Framework

The AI Framework:

- mediates between environmental sensing and musical output  
- interprets patterns and anomalies  
- generates probabilistic and emergent behaviour  
- coordinates transitions and global states  
- maintains coherence across the system  

It functions as the **cognitive layer** of the ecosystem.

